<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="77868755">&lt;p&gt;
    The work product incorporates interactive elements, multimedia resources, and real-world examples to enhance
    understanding and retention of information.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Methods of delivery could include:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Virtual ILT
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Blended Learning
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Self-directed learning or digital learning
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Online portal to search for help content
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Virtual support via chatbots
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Online help built into the solution
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Playbooks/flipbooks
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Quick reference guides
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Top Tips
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
